  "upstream": [],
  "delta": [
    "P25 user-action transaction: (bot_id, nonce) is the idempotency key; a replay returns duplicate with the original eventID and never re-runs effects.",
    "One BEGIN IMMEDIATE transaction appends the action event, every effect.enqueued event and the nonce row; a crash before COMMIT leaves none, a crash after COMMIT leaves all and a retry is duplicate.",
    "Action validation returns rejected/stale without writing or consuming the nonce; the frozen reasons are invalid_action, unexpected_attachments, too_many_attachments, invalid_attachment, missing_text, missing_card_id, unexpected_card_answer_field, missing_card_answer, invalid_approval, missing_thread_id and stale digest_mismatch.",
    "A plan event that is ephemeral, belongs to another bot, reuses an existing eventId, or contains a duplicate/already-enqueued effectKey fails with invalidTransition and consumes no nonce.",
    "These are phone-only vectors; upstream [] because dsh-bot does not export the SQLite transaction."
  ],
